{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible: Approach object. Then, Pick up object. Check object properties. Do specific task. Finally, Place object. Or, Move left/right. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveLeft    /> <Action ID = MoveRight    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = PlaceObject    />",
